production system of any kind,

00:00:03.000 --> 00:00:04.216
that's challenging enough.

00:00:04.216 --> 00:00:06.090
Make it a production
machine learning system,

00:00:06.090 --> 00:00:08.680
and you've got a real
tough one on your hands.

00:00:08.680 --> 00:00:09.660
But fear not.

00:00:09.660 --> 00:00:12.090
This session will get you there.

00:00:12.090 --> 00:00:15.600
NEXT 2018 had over 500
