00:00:15.600 --> 00:00:17.670
that you definitely
couldn't get to them all.

00:00:17.670 --> 00:00:19.950
And if you didn't see
Crossing The Chasm--

00:00:19.950 --> 00:00:22.440
Patterns to Develop,
Operationalize, and Maintain

00:00:22.440 --> 00:00:24.850
Machine Learning
Models, then stay tuned

00:00:24.850 --> 00:00:26.670
because here's the Rewind.

00:00:26.670 --> 00:00:30.072
